+{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T14:43:40.831Z","evidence":{"commit":"2a2f189a4cf44f95b03420280c488971156ae8b6"},"dir_anchors":["lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/operations"],"name":"lifecycle-two-reducer-equivalence-via-shared-table","description":"Proving server live fold and store RunProjectionReducer agree is done transitively (fabro-3fe4): one pure table fabro_types::apply_lifecycle_event consumed by BOTH, plus two thin equivalence tests (xorshift property test durable-reducer-vs-table in run_state.rs::lifecycle_equivalence, and live_lifecycle_status-vs-table step test in fabro-server server/tests.rs). Live-only guards (RunRunnable ingestion suppression) are documented deviations in the step test, not table arms. Historic pre-table stream shapes (Submitted->Starting jumps, fast-forwarded RunFailed) live in fabro_types::historic_skipped_statuses so the shim has one owner and the table stays strict.","files":["lib/apps/fabro-server/src/server.rs","lib/apps/fabro-server/src/server/tests.rs","lib/components/fabro-store/src/run_state.rs","lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/operations/lifecycle_events.rs","lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/operations/mod.rs","lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/operations/resume.rs","lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/operations/start.rs","lib/components/fabro-workflow/src/test_support.rs","lib/foundation/fabro-types/src/lib.rs","lib/foundation/fabro-types/src/lifecycle.rs"],"id":"mx-840e1b"}
